KAISA SITAM NABI KE GHARANE PA HOGAYA<br>
<br>
 WO BEKAJAWA OONTH WO PYASAON KA QAFILA,<br>
 WO SABR AUR WO ZAINAB-E-MUZTAR KA HAUSLA,<br>
 ELHE HARAM PA ZULM YEH THE BAADEY KARBALA,<br>
 KAISA SITAM NABI KE GHARANE PA HOGAYA<br>
<br>
THE BAZUAON MEIN ZAINAB-O-KULSOOM KE RASAN,<br>
 LASHEY THE SAB SHAHEDAON KE MAQTAL MEIN BE KAFAN,<br>
 THI FATIMA KI BETIYAAN BALWE MEIN BE RIDA<br>
 KAISA SITAM NABI KE GHARANE PA HOGAYA<br>
<br>
ZAKHMI BADAN SHAHEEDAON KE THE RAIGEY GARM PAR,<br>
 AUR QAFILEY MEIN NAUKEY SINAAN PAR THE UNKE SAR,<br>
 TADPA RAHA THA SAB KO YEH MANZAR LAHOO BHARA,<br>
 KAISA SITAM NABI KE GHARANE PA HOGAYA<br>
<br>
BALWEY MEIN BE RIDA THI NABI KI NAWASIYAAN,<br>
 BALAON SE APNE MU KO CHUPATI THI BIBIYAAN,<br>
 AUR HAR TARAF HUJOOM TAMASHAIYAON KA THA,<br>
 KAISA SITAM NABI KE GHARANE PA HOGAYA<br>
<br>
GARDAN KO ZAKHMI KARTI RAHI TAUQ &ndash;E-QAARDAAR,<br>
 SAJJAD KE LABAON PA RAHA SHUKR-E-KIRDIGAAR,<br>
 THAME MEHAR OONTAON KI BIMAAR-E-KARBALA,<br>
 KAISA SITAM NABI KE GHARANE PA HOGAYA<br>
<br>
KAISE QALAM LIKHEY GA SAKINA KA THA JO HAAL,<br>
 KANOU SE KHOON BEHTA THA SUJHEY HUVE THE GAAL,<br>
 HAR BIBI ROKE DETI THI ABBAS KO SADA,<br>
 KAISA SITAM NABI KE GHARANE PA HOGAYA<br>
<br>
GARDAN SAKINA BIBI KI RASSI MEIN THI BANDHI,<br>
 WO KAMSINI WO ZAKHM YATEEMI WO TISHNAGI,<br>
 FARIYAAD KYA KAREGI GALA HAI BANDHA HUVA,<br>
 KAISA SITAM NABI KE GHARANE PA HOGAYA<br>
<br>
<br>
DIL MEIN SHAMA QASIM-E-MUZTAR KE NAAM KI,<br>
 ASHK-E-AZAYE SHAH SE HAI AANKHAON MEIN ROUSHNI,<br>
 DETI HAI SUBHA SHAAM HAME FATIMA DUWA,<br>
 KAISA SITAM NABI KE GHARANE PA HOGAYA<br>
<br>
KARTA HAI RASHEED SHAHEEDI YEH ILTEJA,<br>
 NAUHA QUBOOL KIJIYE YA SHAH-E-KARBALA,<br>
 ROTA HAI GHAM MEIN AAP KE KHADIM YEH AAPKA,<br>
 KAISA SITAM NABI KE GHARANE PA HOGAYA..